cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it as below.
title: "rk-tables: Runge-Kutta tables from open-source ODE libraries, checked against the order conditions and their sources"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Giri
    given-names: Ram Chandra
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-7149-7938"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-21
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/rcgiri-physics/rk-tables
abstract: >-
  823 Butcher tables read from 34 open-source ODE libraries at pinned versions,
  checked against the order conditions with physverify and to 50 digits, with a
  NodePy second opinion and comparisons with first published sources, grouped
  into 362 methods. Includes errata for published sources and confirmed library
  defects, and a script that re-checks every table.
keywords:
  - Runge-Kutta
  - Butcher tableau
  - order conditions
  - ODE solvers
  - code verification
